<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK DEC DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.46 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK DEC DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.46 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on Thursday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the rest of the month was 6.46 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Dec 10			7,300</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Dec		6,339</p>
<p> Average reserves to Dec 4			    5,527</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,460</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
